ng</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 为固定变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathfrak A}=\\operatorname{TrueCode}_{\\mathfrak A,g}\">\\(\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathfrak A}=\\operatorname{TrueCode}_{\\mathfrak A,g}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"2d8f5002c4256603\" href=\"?note=2d8f5002c4256603\" title=\"57-df-truth-predicate\">57-df-truth-predicate</a>；代入数码取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"afc42c965ba86683\" href=\"?note=afc42c965ba86683\" title=\"57-df-numeral\">57-df-numeral</a>。本文件 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Dec}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"4107e891ce817208\" href=\"?note=4107e891ce817208\" title=\"57-df-decidable-theory\">57-df-decidable-theory</a> 的理论类，演算固定为标准 Hilbert 演算。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE}\">\\(\\mathrm{RE}\\)</span> 是数值集合类。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1^0\">\\(\\Sigma_1^0\\)</span> 仅在下式第二行表示 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-19\" data-note=\"5a8141676f191f64\" href=\"?note=5a8141676f191f64\" title=\"57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy\">57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy</a> 的语法公式集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_1\">\\(E_1\\)</span> 为其标准真句子的码集。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathfrak N)\\notin\\mathrm{Dec}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathfrak N)\\notin\\mathrm{Dec}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E_1\\coloneqq g[\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathfrak N)\\cap\\Sigma_1^0],\\qquad E_1\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\setminus\\mathrm{Rec}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E_1\\coloneqq g[\\mathrm{Th}(